<div class="about-content">
    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>The job market is broken. Fresh graduates send hundreds of applications into void. Employers struggle to find candidates who actually fit. The existing platforms rely on keyword matching that fails to understand what people truly bring to the table.</p>
    <p>JOBCARE fixes this with AI that listens. Our voice-first technology lets candidates express their skills, aspirations, and preferences naturally — and matches them with employers who need exactly those capabilities.</p>

    <h2>For Job Seekers</h2>
    <p>Whether you're a fresh graduate entering the workforce, someone between jobs, or looking to pivot your career — JOBCARE levels the playing field. No more getting filtered out by ATS systems because you didn't use the right keywords. Our AI understands the substance behind your experience.</p>

    <h2>For Employers</h2>
    <p>Stop sifting through hundreds of mismatched resumes. JOBCARE pre-screens candidates using AI that understands role requirements beyond job descriptions. Find the right people faster, reduce hiring costs, and build teams that actually work.</p>
</div>

